.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH remote 1  "remote " 
.SH NAME
remote \- Inspect and manage your cloud snippets
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBremote\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and manage your cloud snippets
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
remote\-list(1)
List your cloud snippets (or your stars with \-\-stars)
.TP
remote\-show(1)
Show one cloud snippet in full
.TP
remote\-delete(1)
Delete one of your cloud snippets (soft\-delete, 30\-day undo)
.TP
remote\-visibility(1)
Change a snippet\*(Aqs visibility: public|unlisted|private
.TP
remote\-search(1)
Search public snippets on the registry
.TP
remote\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg remote list
  fg remote search docker
  fg remote list \-\-stars
